# The built programs that no suite runs as a probe, each with its caller or its
# use. tools/verify/probecheck.sh reads this file.
drmcapture capture of a card's scanout and its CRC-32, run by the graphics runners in their guests (tests/graphics/Readme.md)
hello program that other probes, suites and host tests run or open
hotplugprobe manual display hotplug check: a QEMU window resize or a VNC SetDesktopSize reaches it as a uevent and a new preferred mode (rach2/sys/drm/Readme.md)
idreport identity and environment fixture for account probes
lenovoacpi Lenovo ACPI acceptance run by the native collection on each release
musl/budgetmusl manual resource budget diagnostic
musl/catfile manual file reader
musl/cowfork manual copy-on-write diagnostic
musl/ctrlcmusl manual interactive signal test
musl/devtest manual device test
musl/hdaprobe manual audio path and rate diagnostic
musl/hello manual musl startup smoke test
musl/kvmmusl KVM run page and fork check, run by the native collection on the Lenovo, whose VMX no suite profile has yet
musl/kvmslotmusl KVM memory slot check, run by the native collection on the Lenovo; its guest rows need a backend that runs guests
musl/mallocqsort manual allocation and sort test
musl/ofdmusl manual open file description test
musl/pipemusl manual pipe test
musl/pollmusl manual poll test
musl/ptymusl manual pseudo-terminal test
musl/rngmusl manual random device test
musl/sockfillmusl manual listening-socket call test
musl/statushelper child status and signal fixture for musl/ishmusl
musl/tcpsendrecv manual tcp peer test
musl/ttymusl manual terminal test
musl/vfiomusl VFIO container, groups and their /sys entries, run by the native collection on the Lenovo, whose VT-d no suite profile has yet
suidhelper identity fixture staged at several owners and modes
